1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,120
Before I end this meeting, let me remind everyone that the annual summer picnic will take place this Saturday.

2
00:00:06,905 --> 00:00:17,380
It'll be at Griswold Park from 11 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. If you need a ride there, a bus is going to be picking people up here at 10:30 in the morning.

3
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:22,400
Just wait between the employee parking lot and the western entrance to the main building.

4
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:30,320
As for the picnic, we'll have the usual food, and we'll also play a wide variety of games and do other activities.

5
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:42,115
Your family members are welcome to attend, but please contact Janet Hoff at extension 584 to inform her of how many people will be accompanying you.
